      "text_length": 1897,
      "identity_excerpt": "SC Form 01 Small Claims Affidavit Page 1 of 2 Revision Date: November 2024 STATE OF WYOMING ) IN THE CIRCUIT COURT ) ss COUNTY OF ________________ ) _______________ JUDICIAL DISTRICT Plaintiff: , ) Case Number________________ (Person or Entity Asserting a Right to Money) ) ) vs. ) ) Defendant:__________________________. ) (Person or Entity Alleged to Owe Money) ) SMALL CLAIMS AFFIDAVIT 1. I state that the Defendant owes me money in the following amounts: Principal $ Prejudgment Interest $ Attorney Fees $ Filing Fees $10.00 Service Fees $ TOTAL $ 2. The Defendant owes me this money because: 3. ☐ I have invoices, receipts, or agreements that support my claim. I will take copies of those papers to the Clerk of Court when I file this Affidavit. Important Note: Some Clerks will file those copies with your Affidavit. Other Clerks will instruct you to bring those copies back with you when you have a hearing (meeting) with the judge. 4. ☐ I already demanded that the Defendant pay me this money. 5. ☐ The Defendant refused to pay me. 6. ☐ As far as I know, the Defendant is not a deployed active-duty member of the United States Armed Forces. SC Form 01 Small Claims Affidavit Page 2 of 2 Revis"
